@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Weather Monitoring System)

[*] --> RegistrationOrLogin

state RegistrationOrLogin <<choice>>
RegistrationOrLogin --> Register : [New user]
RegistrationOrLogin --> Login : [Registered user]

state Register <<final>>
state Login <<final>>

state RegisteredUser <<choice>>
Login --> CheckLocation : [Check weather after login]
CheckLocation --> ValidLocation : [Valid location entered]
ValidLocation --> ChooseWeatherInfo : [Choose what to check]
ChooseWeatherInfo --> ShowWeatherInfo : [Show selected weather information]
ShowWeatherInfo --> ViewDetails : [View additional details]
ViewDetails --> Logout : [Logout]

state NewUser <<choice>>
Register --> SaveRegistration : [Save registration if valid]
SaveRegistration --> LoginAfterRegister : [Login after successful registration]
LoginAfterRegister --> CheckLocation : [Check weather after login]

@enduml
